  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">PROSAUDE III Health Sector Multi Donor Fund</narrative>
  </title>
  <description>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">PROSA&#xda;DE III supports the MISAU in the implementation of the PESS 2014-2019/2024. The primary mission of the MISAU is to lead the production and offering of more and better basic health services, universally accessible, through a decentralised system prioritising partnership, in order to maximise the health and wellbeing of all Mozambicans, permitting them to leave a productive life, contributing to personal and national development. The goal of the PROSA&#xda;DE III financing mechanism mirrors the MISAU&#x2019;s mission, and is to support the construction of an increasingly robust and effective quality health system that benefits the Mozambican population, thereby contributing to the sustainable development of the country.</narrative>
  </description>
